        "[G]A thousand [C/G]snares beset my [G]feet,",
        "[G]A [C]thousand [G]foes are [D]lurking nigh.",
        "[G]Still Thou the [C/G]raging of the sea,",
        "[C]O [G]Master! let [D]me [D7]walk [G/D]with [D]Thee."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D7]If [G]I may rest my [Am/C]hand in [D7]Thine,",
        "[G]I'll [Em]count the [C]joys of earth but loss,",
        "[G]And firmly, [C/G]bravely journey [G]on;",
        "[G]I'll [C]bear the [G]banner [D]of the cross",
        "[G]Till Zion's glorious [C/G]gates I see;",
        "[C]Yet, [G]Savior, let [D]me [D7]walk [G/D]with [D]Thee."
